# DormNet
 DormNet is a proposed Internet monitoring and accssibility mapping system for Pisay dormitories.
 It aims to collect, organize, and analyze Wi-Fi performance data from different locations and times to identify areas with weak or 
 inconsistent connectivity. The system will present the results through summaries, comparisons, and a visual Wi-Fi accessibility map.
 This is inspired by the fluctuating internet connection in the girl's dormitory 1.
